# mortar.px (v2) - ground artillery emplacement (Area 2, NEON GRID rooftops), aggressive alien machinery pass
# canvas 24x24, 2 frames (core glow pulse, loop). Straight top-down, faces DOWN (eyes and mandibles toward the player).
# armoured hex carapace standing on four pointed rust strut legs (X silhouette, spike feet at the corners);
# two crest horns at the rear, two pincer mandibles hooking in at the front around a red eye pair.
# Big round steel muzzle (10 px) whose dark bore holds a 2x2 fire core that pulses as the shell charges.
# Unlike turret-base (rust octagon plate, dark socket, rotating barrel) and the crawler (tracked hull).
# light: top-left (carapace lit left bevel d, right side one step darker; muzzle rim 4 -> 2 top-left to
# bottom-right; legs: TL/BR ridge on the upper side, TR/BL lit NW side).
# smallest must-read feature: the red eye pair (2x2 each); the 2x2 core glow.
# anchor: frame centre (12,12) ~ muzzle centre (11.5,10.5 edge coords).
# timing: 250 ms each (15 ticks). Only the 4 core pixels change (O <-> Q).
